    rdfs:label "Activity: activityongoing activityhalted states" ;
    rdfs:comment "States of the activityongoing activityhalted path of the Activity workflow, in order: ActivityOngoing, ActivityHalted. A transition is legal between adjacent states. An activity's lifecycle in the Data Privacy Vocabulary: proposed, planned, ongoing, halted, completed, not completed." ;
